{"title":"Art of Problem Solving Initiative","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Art of Problem Solving Initiative</b> (or <b>AoPS Foundation</b>) is a 501(c)3 non-profit corporation that supports exploration of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematical_problem_solving\" title=\"Mathematical problem solving\">mathematical problem solving</a> by middle and high school students.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Projects_and_Programs\">Projects and Programs</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving_Initiative&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Projects and Programs\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The Art of Problem Solving Foundation administers the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=United_States_of_America_Mathematical_Talent_Search\" title=\"United States of America Mathematical Talent Search\">United States of America Mathematical Talent Search</a>.</li>\n<li>The Art of Problem Solving Initiative runs <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Bridge_to_Enter_Advanced_Mathematics\" title=\"Bridge to Enter Advanced Mathematics\">Bridge to Enter Advanced Mathematics</a>.</li>\n<li>The AoPS Foundation helps fundraise and keep financial accounts for the following local math programs:\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_Math_Circle\" title=\"San Diego Math Circle\">San Diego Math Circle</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Stanford_Math_Circle&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Stanford Math Circle (page does not exist)\">Stanford Math Circle</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Colorado_ARML\" title=\"Colorado ARML\">Colorado ARML</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Charlotte_Mathematics_Club&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Charlotte Mathematics Club (page does not exist)\">Charlotte Mathematics Club</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Soli_Deo_Gloria_Home_Educators\" title=\"Soli Deo Gloria Home Educators\">Soli Deo Gloria Home Educators</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=The_Teachers%27_Circle&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"The Teachers&#39; Circle (page does not exist)\">The Teachers' Circle</a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Albany_Area_Math_Circle\" title=\"Albany Area Math Circle\">Albany Area Math Circle</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving_Initiative&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving\">Art of Problem Solving</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Bridge_to_Enter_Advanced_Mathematics\" title=\"Bridge to Enter Advanced Mathematics\">Bridge to Enter Advanced Mathematics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=United_States_of_America_Mathematical_Talent_Search\" title=\"United States of America Mathematical Talent Search\">United States of America Mathematical Talent Search</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_Links\">External Links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving_Initiative&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: External Links\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.artofproblemsolving.org\">Official Website</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018073146\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU tim